==English==

===Etymology===
From {{OF.}} ''[[blestre]]''.

===Pronunciation===
*: Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-ɪstə(r)|-ɪstə(r)]]

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# A small [[bubble]] on the [[skin]], that contains watery fluid and is caused by [[burn]]ing, pressure or [[infect]]ion.
# A swelling on a plant.
# A bubble, as on a painted surface.

====Synonyms====
* [[bleb]]
* [[bulla]]

